      "content": "\"laying down\" sounds like a relief, but it's just a temporary thing. eventually i have to wake up and face the same broken person. i keep thinking about how much easier it would be if i just didn't have to deal with the weight anymore. like, if the struggle was just... finished. not \"fixed,\" but just finished. does that make sense? or am i just being dramatic?",
